# Ketra Orc support (KetraOrcSupport): the warehouse keeper of a Ketra Orc ally of level 4 whose private
# warehouse holds an item answers its warehouse page; the withdrawal event releases the client, opens the
# withdrawal list, then answers the no-quest page, as the event's answer stays the default.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (KetraOrcSupport.onFirstTalk, onAdvEvent) and replay
# the reference trace.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/ketra_support_warehouse.golden
character Ally 40
standing 4
warehouse 7186 1
script script.feature.KetraOrcSupport
item 7186
page script/feature/KetraOrcSupport/
npc jaff 31374 WarehouseKeeper 10 10 0

action jaff
action jaff
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=jaff item=0 page=script/feature/KetraOrcSupport/31374-4.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest KetraOrcSupport Withdraw
  S ActionFailed
  S WarehouseWithdrawList kind=1 adena=0 items=7186x1
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=jaff item=0 html="<html><body>You are either not on a quest that involves this NPC, or you don't meet this NPC's minimum quest requirements.</body></html>"
  S ActionFailed
